{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Re-touch 是一款為 iPhone 而設的互動化妝數碼鏡，利用前置相機協助化妝與整理儀容，會按房間光線自動調整，並可放大正在處理的面部位置。它適合日常化妝、補妝或外出前整理儀容的人士，原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-249.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自動補光與手勢縮放</h2>\n<p>它具備自動補光，在昏暗房間會調亮螢幕、開啟柔和邊緣光並調整色調，盡量保持膚色準確。手勢縮放可將化妝刷或筆靠近眼部或嘴唇，畫面便會放大該處，轉頭亦可查看左右面部；另可捏合縮放或從縮放列選擇面部、眼部、嘴唇。整體妝容檢查支援可重播特點，穩定畫面則有助減少手震。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-54.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-55.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-56.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-57.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Re-touch: The Better Mirror</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/re-touch-the-better-mirror/id6827142921?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T21:27:10.562576+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T21:10:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:37:18.527772+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T21:20:40.717568+00:00","content_hash":"6de497b7a537635d1c2da87894cf2904fd6fd609b2ab9e947cc0fe3fc81b1ffd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}